<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>API Rest - Test Controller</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .container {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        h1 {
            color: #667eea;
            margin-top: 0;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #667eea;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #374151;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .api-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #10b981;
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .endpoint-info {
            background: #f3f4f6;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
        }
        .endpoint-info code {
            background: #1f2937;
            color: #10b981;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>API Rest</h1>
        <div class="api-badge">GET /api/test</div>
        <p>Welcome to the REST API</p>

        <div class="endpoint-info">
            <strong>Endpoint:</strong> <code>/api/test</code><br>
            <strong>Method:</strong> <code>GET</code><br>
            <strong>Controller:</strong> TestController
        </div>

        <p>This is a test endpoint to verify your REST API is working correctly.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>